{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act12side_level_act12side_09_end",
  "groupId": "act12side",
  "stageId": "act12side_09",
  "title": "鼠膽龍威",
  "storyCode": "DH-9",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act12side/level_act12side_09_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "cc3f37afd457fe76fd7202a38670b0d4b51c6aaebacd425f9807bfcc00315685",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_20_G09"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，快看，那邊被追趕的是老陳和林小姐吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，兩位世侄，了不起，真是了不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們快去救......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "忽然，已經駛到距離海岸不遠處的遊輪上發出了巨大的爆炸聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你搞了什麼東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一點驚喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是問你，救完人之後幹什麼嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然我也同意直接走人，但是我想起我身上還有炸彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "於是就給他們多留了一點驚喜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喝一杯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還真是有雅興。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "開出來的時候才看到，就稍微擺了一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道你是不是故意的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你忘了？“而當你接過他們的班時，你不能只走他們的老路。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說這段話的時候，我們的通訊還沒有斷開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你老實告訴我，那件事裡，你沒有做我所想的那些事，對嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......到岸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你輸了，老頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幫助坎黛拉那個女人，小姑娘，你們不理解自己做了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你做得好啊，老潘喬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "船長手下",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_193",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坎黛拉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "住手。我們已經輸了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明智的選擇，老潘喬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來，坐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坎黛拉，你想幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看不懂嗎？請你吃飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "潘喬冷哼一聲，卻還是坐在了坎黛拉的對面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別的人在這個時候恐怕已經嚇破膽了，我就是看中你這一點，老潘喬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經輸了，你沒有把我抓起來，還請我坐在這裡，你究竟想幹什麼？羞辱我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聊一聊，老潘喬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "用埃內斯托來分散我的注意力，讓手下參加比賽，透過比賽在城市各處埋好炸彈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最後在第三輪前夕發難，挾持船上的富豪和權貴讓我不能輕舉妄動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不得不說，這一次，可能是我最接近失去這座城市的一次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*玻利瓦爾俚語*，我真是不明白，坎黛拉，為了這一次的計畫，我和我的手下準備了多少個日日夜夜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你，你只是恰好請了兩個什麼都不知道的外地人，恰好把這件事交給她們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而她們，她們居然就正好破壞了我的計畫！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼贏的是你這樣的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我贏了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在說什麼，潘喬，我的老潘喬，看來你在我的城市裡待了太久，連我是什麼人都忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者說，你從未瞭解過我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的對手從來都不是我，你也沒有輸給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是失敗了，就這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在最厭惡的城市中生活了十數年，說著痛恨三方政府的話，卻為了推翻我而不得不接受其中一家的資助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我猜猜，是萊塔尼亞的某一位吧，啊，我甚至能大概想到是哪一位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告訴我，老潘喬，你是怎麼想的，居然向那些吃人不吐骨頭的傢伙尋求幫助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，意思是，你學會了忍辱負重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你為什麼不向我搖尾乞憐呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼知道我不會幫助你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說真的，老潘喬，要是你來求我，我說不定真的會給你人和錢去打你最愛的戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你最後贏了，那這座城市也會投靠你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我覺得不會有比這更有吸引力的方案了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我這輩子都不可能向你低頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你這種人啊，就是在這方面太頑固了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們這樣的人，對於完整，獨立這樣的詞彙總是有著一種不切實際的期待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們妄想著有一種氣節會將你們聯繫起來，你們追尋著一種象徵能夠讓你們團結其下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而事實上，玻利瓦爾從一開始就沒有獨立過，既然沒有歷史，又談何氣節，談何象徵？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你成功了，你所建立的玻利瓦爾真的是你想像中的玻利瓦爾嗎？我看不見得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管你怎麼說，我所想的從一開始就只是終結戰爭，讓玻利瓦爾和平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天我失敗了，我認栽，坎黛拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是你記住，我的事業或許不是正義的，但我至少要比你正義！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，對不起，瞧我，又把你和你背後的人混為一談了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不是我所描述的那類人，你發自內心地想要拯救這個國家，所以你能夠坐在這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，作為對你失敗的懲罰，我還是把你當做他們的代表吧，這樣說起來比較方便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來沒有自詡過正義，我親愛的老潘喬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不關心三方政府想幹什麼，我也不關心你們的玻利瓦爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事實上，你說我沉迷於這座城市，這也是錯誤的，我不關心這座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我關心的是這座城市代表的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "潘喬",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_192_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意義？娛樂到死就是你在乎的意義？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你這樣的老頑固，永遠不懂金錢的意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，把這個老東西帶下去吧，我之後再和他聊聊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩下那些抵抗的，你們應該知道怎麼處理吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖嘖，這場面，鴻門宴也不過如此了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在旁邊看著都感覺頭皮發麻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺和以前爸爸跟爺爺吃飯時的氣氛似的，我每次都受不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "確實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星熊？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林雨霞",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_196_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "詩懷雅？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們兩個身上都是水，趕緊擦擦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們怎麼會在這裡？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_203_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，這就說來話長了。之後吃飯的時候慢慢說吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "詩懷雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_197_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，事情變成這樣，我可沒胃口吃飯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位世侄，瞧我，光顧著和老潘喬說話，居然把最大的功臣給冷落了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，那邊的，趕緊拉兩架無人機過來，燈光也打過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們做得漂亮，實在是太漂亮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "魏彥吾真是讓我認識了兩個大好後輩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也為這場大獎賽貢獻了一個精彩絕倫的收尾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大獎賽？收尾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，不出意外的話，現在應該有很多人正坐在電視前看著你我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "雖然船內發生的事我們沒有拍到，但是陳世侄你在甲板上和潘喬對峙的那一幕，一定深深印在了所有人的心中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，他們必然都在為你們歡呼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您曾經說過，只要有您在，就不會有任何人威脅到這座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，沒錯，這句話有什麼問題嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道眼前發生的事就不算威脅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈哈，陳世侄，你還是太年輕了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼是威脅？是這座城市被夷平？是這座城市裡的人死光了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都不是，都不是，陳世侄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真正的威脅是人們不再有欲望，是人們不再追求享樂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你也做了這麼多年警察，你認為有可能嗎，陳世侄？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，你的表情告訴了我你的答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，你也明白，答案是不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而只要答案是不可能，這座城市就將永遠存在，多索雷斯沒了，還會有特雷索雷斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論幾座，我都能給你造出來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerId": "avg_1013_spchen_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是，這並不能掩蓋你們是這座城市的英雄的事實。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "噢，瞧我，忘了這件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宴會準備好了沒有？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "護衛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_207",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "基本準備好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的話筒呢......哦，在這。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳，親愛的市民們，遊客們，無論你此時身在電視機前，還是依然留在沙灘上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我非常榮幸地向你們介紹本次極限鐵人大獎賽的最終勝利者，同時也是拯救了這座城市的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "來自龍門的兩位女俠——陳暉潔，林雨霞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "非常感謝老潘喬用自己的親身行動為我們帶來的表演！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "坎黛拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_198_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下來，我們將在沙灘上舉辦宴會，歡迎所有人來參與！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
